      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what's being tested.Now I have a clear picture of the test. I'll improve understandability by removing unused imports, grouping assertions with descriptive comments that explain the intent of each boundary scenario, and adding a `@DisplayName` annotation.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed 10 unused imports, added a `@DisplayName` annotation describing the clamping behaviour, and replaced the cryptic `//` separators with descriptive inline comments that explain the intent of each assertion group (zero passthrough, lower-bound clamping, upper-bound clamping, long extremes, and short range passthrough)."
